<Data>Data Flow Analysis : OFDMA_LTE_A_Analysis&#x000D;&#x000A;8/5/2016..2:08 PM&#x000D;&#x000A;LTE_A_DL_Src_RangeCheck &apos;OFDMA_LTE_A_Design__LTE_A_DL_Src_1.LTE_DL_MIMO_4Ant_Src_RangeCheck&apos;: &#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;System Configurations:&#x000D;&#x000A;1. Frame structure is FDD.&#x000D;&#x000A;2. Channel bandwidth is 5 MHz.&#x000D;&#x000A;3. Cell ID is 0.&#x000D;&#x000A;4. Normal cyclic prefix is employed.&#x000D;&#x000A;5. The transmission mode of each UE is {Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1}.&#x000D;&#x000A;6. The number of Tx antennas is .1.&#x000D;&#x000A;7. The number of CRS (Cell specific Reference Signal) ports is 1.&#x000D;&#x000A;8. The mapping type of virtual resource blocks to physical resource blocks for all radio frames is Localized.&#x000D;&#x000A;9. Number of OFDM symbols used for transmission of PDCCHs of the 10 downlink subframes are {2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2}.&#x000D;&#x000A;10. PDCCH Formats of the 10 downlink subframes are: &#x000D;&#x000A;  For each subframe, the first 6 elements indicate the formats of the PDCCH candidates in UE specific search space, while the rest 4 elements indicate the formats of PDCCH candicates in common search space.&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 0:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 1:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 2:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 3:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 4:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 5:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 6:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 7:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 8:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 9:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;11. DCI Formats of the 10 downlink subframes are:&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 0:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 1:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 2:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 3:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 4:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 5:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 6:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 7:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 8:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 9:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;12. CSI RS is not transmitted.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 1:&#x000D;&#x000A;1. The Transmission mode of this UE is Mode 1.&#x000D;&#x000A;2. HARQ closed-loop transmission is enabled.&#x000D;&#x000A;  The number of HARQ processes is 8. The maximum number of HARQ transmission per each HARQ process is 4.&#x000D;&#x000A;3.Adaptive modulation and coding scheme is not enabled.&#x000D;&#x000A;4. For Codeword  1, transport block sizes of the 10 subframes are {1608, 1608, 1608, 1608, 1608, 1608, 1608, 1608, 1608, 1608}.&#x000D;&#x000A;5. For Codeword 1, modulation orders of the 10 subframes are {QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK}.&#x000D;&#x000A;6. Number of allocated resource blocks (RBs) of the 10 subframes are {13, 13, 13, 13, 13, 13, 13, 13, 13, 13}.&#x000D;&#x000A;7. Number of symbols (resource elements (REs)) on each layer available for UE 1 of the 10 subframes are {1549, 1794, 1794, 1794, 1794, 1710, 1794, 1794, 1794, 1794}.&#x000D;&#x000A;8. For Codeword 1, number of channel bits for UE 1 of the 10 subframes are {3098, 3588, 3588, 3588, 3588, 3420, 3588, 3588, 3588, 3588}.&#x000D;&#x000A;9. For Codeword  1, code rates of the 10 subframes are {0.519, 0.4482, 0.4482, 0.4482, 0.4482, 0.4702, 0.4482, 0.4482, 0.4482, 0.4482}.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 2:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 3:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 4:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 5:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 6:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A;LTE_A_DL_Src_RangeCheck &apos;OFDMA_LTE_A_Design__LTE_A_DL_Src_0.LTE_DL_MIMO_4Ant_Src_RangeCheck&apos;: &#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;System Configurations:&#x000D;&#x000A;1. Frame structure is FDD.&#x000D;&#x000A;2. Channel bandwidth is 5 MHz.&#x000D;&#x000A;3. Cell ID is 0.&#x000D;&#x000A;4. Normal cyclic prefix is employed.&#x000D;&#x000A;5. The transmission mode of each UE is {Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1, Mode 1}.&#x000D;&#x000A;6. The number of Tx antennas is .1.&#x000D;&#x000A;7. The number of CRS (Cell specific Reference Signal) ports is 1.&#x000D;&#x000A;8. The mapping type of virtual resource blocks to physical resource blocks for all radio frames is Localized.&#x000D;&#x000A;9. Number of OFDM symbols used for transmission of PDCCHs of the 10 downlink subframes are {2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2}.&#x000D;&#x000A;10. PDCCH Formats of the 10 downlink subframes are: &#x000D;&#x000A;  For each subframe, the first 6 elements indicate the formats of the PDCCH candidates in UE specific search space, while the rest 4 elements indicate the formats of PDCCH candicates in common search space.&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 0:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 1:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 2:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A&#x000D;&#x000A;  Subframe 3:    0  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  N/A  